{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"深水埗舊樓疑跌角鐵擊傷女途人\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FALL-SSP-261115-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】深水埗舊樓疑有角鐵墮下，擊傷女途人送院治理。</p><p>現場是鴨寮街1至7號近白楊街，有警員在現場搜證。事發於下午約四時，一名女途人途經該大廈時被硬物擊中，她清醒送往明愛醫院治理。現場消息稱，懷疑該硬物是一件角鐵，警方正調查事故原因。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:00:23.203658+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:08:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:54.286569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:54:15.596620+00:00","content_hash":"02ff023c4cf2d21ca7793745069f5e0491d4ded0a076b6598662bba4138b9238","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}